(F5 W2 V2: print_vtk_node_method, the older manual name of
 print_vtk_node_type, is stored as print_vtk_node_type: deformed POINTS
 at t=0.5, node 2 x 0.9987142857143 as print_vtk_node_type1.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
